=============================================================================
TEMPLATE_FRONTEND_ASTRO_JF - MANIFIESTO DE INFRAESTRUCTURA (.env.example)
=============================================================================
INSTRUCCIONES:
1. Copia este archivo como .env.
2. Astro no usa process.env por defecto; usa import.meta.env.
3. Solo las variables con prefijo PUBLIC_ serán visibles en el cliente.
4. Respeta el SECURITY_FIREWALL.md: No subas secretos al repositorio.
=============================================================================
--- CORE INFRASTRUCTURE ---
URL canónica para sitemaps y metadatos dinámicos.
SITE_URL=http://localhost:4321

--- DATABASE & PERSISTENCE ---
URI de conexión a MongoDB Atlas.
MONGODB_URI=

--- PRIVATE API KEYS (SERVER ONLY) ---
Estas variables NUNCA deben llevar el prefijo PUBLIC_.
CLAUDE_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

Auth Services (Astro Auth / Auth.js)
AUTH_SECRET=
AUTH_TRUST_HOST=true

OAuth Providers
GITHUB_ID=
GITHUB_SECRET=
GOOGLE_ID=
GOOGLE_SECRET=

Email (Resend)
RESEND_API_KEY=

Payments (Backend Secret)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

--- PUBLIC UI CONFIGURATION (CLIENT HYDRATION) ---
Estas variables son inyectadas en el bundle del navegador.
Telemetry & Analytics
PUBLIC_GA_ID=
PUBLIC_CLARITY_ID=
PUBLIC_CRISP_ID=

Payments (Frontend Identity)
PUBLIC_STRIPE_KEY=
PUBLIC_MERCADOPAGO_KEY=

Branding & Metadata
PUBLIC_APP_NAME=Template_FrontEnd_Astro_JF
PUBLIC_APP_DESCRIPTION=
PUBLIC_DOMAIN_NAME=

Theme & UI State
PUBLIC_DEFAULT_THEME=dark
PUBLIC_DEFAULT_LANG=es

--- STRIPE PRICE CATALOG (PUBLIC) ---
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRICE_STARTER=
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PRICE_ADVANCED=

Metadata de Planes (UI)
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PLAN_STARTER_NAME=
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PLAN_STARTER_PRICE=
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PLAN_ADVANCED_NAME=
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PLAN_ADVANCED_PRICE=

--- STORAGE & CDN ---
PUBLIC_AWS_BUCKET=
PUBLIC_AWS_BUCKET_URL=
PUBLIC_AWS_CDN=